    <unit id="=&gt;q1" name="=&gt;q1">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">2</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Looking for some scrap? I got you covered.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Шукаєте якийсь мотлох? Я вас прикрию.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="translated">&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a3" name="=&gt;a3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Show me what you have. ::Barter.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Покажіть мені, що у вас є. ::Торгівля.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a4" name="=&gt;a4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Merchants here only accept stygian coins? How do I get some of those?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Торговці тут приймають лише стигійські монети? Як мені їх дістати?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>You can buy charons from Colton with other currencies if that's what you're looking to do.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ви можете купити Харонів у Колтона за інші валюти, якщо це те, що ви шукаєте.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a6" name="=&gt;a6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Would you happen to by any chance have an Armadillo class drill rotor circuit board?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ви випадково не маєте друкованої плати ланцюга ротора класу "Броненосець"?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>I don't know, maybe. I don't have too much electronics right now but take a look anyway, you might find it. But no refunds! It won't be my fault if you buy the wrong thing.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Не знаю, може й маю. Зараз у мене не так багато електроніки, але подивіться, можливо, ви знайдете. Але без повернень! Це не моя провина, якщо ви купите не те.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a8" name="=&gt;a8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Alright, I'll have a look. ::Barter::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Гаразд, я подивлюся. ::Торгівля::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a9" name="=&gt;a9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>I don't have time to look through all that junk.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">У мене немає часу перебирати весь цей мотлох.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a10" name="=&gt;a10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated" xml:space="preserve">
        <source>Catch you later.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Побачимося пізніше.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
